<title>USA: Reading &amp; Bates drilling rig in tow damaged.</title>
<headline>Reading &amp; Bates drilling rig in tow damaged.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reading &amp; Bates Corp said a semi-submersible drilling unit was damaged on February 23, 1997 while under tow into the port of Brindisi, Italy.</p>
<p>The drilling unit's forward port thruster and aft starboard thruster and under side of the pontoons were damaged by an uncharted underwater obstruction, the company said.</p>
<p>The unit completed a contract offshore Albania and was being towed to prepare for upgrades prior to a drilling contract in the North Sea, Reading &amp; Bates said.  </p>
<p>Reading &amp; Bates said it believes the damage and any business interruption will be &quot;adequately covered by insurance.&quot;</p>
